---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  layouts/page.njk
  A bare-bones layout for simple one-off pages that are just a title and
  some text — currently only used by 404.md. About and Contact have their
  own more specific layouts (layouts/about.njk, layouts/contact.njk)
  because they each show extra structured info beyond plain text.
#}

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="page-body">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>
</div>
